# Vital Seed Giving Page (Locked)

The `/experience/giving` Vital Seed giving experience is **approved and locked**. Do not modify unless the operator explicitly requests a giving-page change in the active prompt.

## Protected surfaces

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `app/experience/giving/page.tsx` | Route entry — do not edit |
| `components/experience/giving/ExperienceGivingPageClient.tsx` | Page shell |
| `components/vital-seed/VitalSeedGivingForm.tsx` | Background plates, checkout, artboard scaling |
| `components/vital-seed/VitalSeedOverlay.tsx` | Desktop overlay — absolute `%` positions |
| `components/vital-seed/VitalSeedMobileOverlay.tsx` | Mobile overlay — absolute `%` positions |
| `components/vital-seed/SowVitalSeedButton.tsx` | CTA placement |
| `public/images/vital-seed/*` | Background PNGs and icons |

## Do not change without explicit approval

- Background images (`desktop-background.png`, `mobile-background.png`)
- Overlay `%` positions, labels, dummy metrics, or live Recent Activity feed rotation
- Quick give amounts, keypad layout, payment/journey sections
- Stripe checkout wiring (`/api/checkout`, amount validation, thank-you modal)
- Asset paths under `/images/vital-seed/`

## Allowed (only when explicitly requested)

- Critical checkout or access bugs
- Viewport scaling wrapper adjustments in `VitalSeedGivingForm.tsx` (must preserve overlay alignment)
- Copy or legal text updates named by the operator

## Forbidden

- Refactors into deprecated `components/vital-seed/giving/*` files
- Replacing absolute overlays with flex/grid card layouts
- `max-w-md` / phone-frame letterboxing on the giving artboard
- Unsolicited styling, cleanup, or “while I'm here” edits in protected files

## Verification before any approved edit

1. Desktop and mobile backgrounds unchanged unless operator supplies new art
2. Overlay hit targets still align with background plates at 320, 768, 1024, 1440, 1920
3. Recent Activity rotates 3 of 5 dummy items every 4 seconds on desktop
4. Checkout still posts `{ amountInCents }` to `/api/checkout`
